00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:10.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pati yung kabayo.

asr-000221
00:25:11.360 --> 00:25:14.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sa ten-wheeler truck na siya sinasakay.

