00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:36.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You have the floor.

asr-000302
00:27:38.460 --> 00:27:46.340
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sa ating kagalang-galang na chairman ng Committee on Agriculture,

asr-000303
00:27:46.340 --> 00:27:48.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Agrarian Reform and Environment.

asr-000304
00:27:50.240 --> 00:27:55.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At ang aking schoolmate sa LaSalle Green Hills,

asr-000305
00:27:56.100 --> 00:28:01.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: at mas magandang lalaki po sa akin ng isang paligo lamang.

asr-000306
00:28:02.820 --> 00:28:04.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Idol ko ho to sa agrikultura.

asr-000307
00:28:04.960 --> 00:28:07.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Gusto ko ho paglaki ko katulad ko siya.

asr-000308
00:28:08.020 --> 00:28:12.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At ganon din po ang ating kagalagalang na majority floor leader

asr-000309
00:28:12.720 --> 00:28:16.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: na matagal ko na hong kilala.

asr-000310
00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:20.820
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In fact, noong NIA administrator pa lang ako,

asr-000311
00:28:21.600 --> 00:28:25.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ay nag-inaugurate po kami ng electrification project.

asr-000312
00:28:26.100 --> 00:28:32.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sa isang liblib na barangay at first term ho na congressman niya,

asr-000313
00:28:33.100 --> 00:28:40.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: eh may nakisakay pong buntis sa sama ho ng daan noon sa bukid noon.

asr-000314
00:28:40.680 --> 00:28:44.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sa haba ng biyahe, nanganak po yung buntis doon sa likod.

asr-000315
00:28:45.440 --> 00:28:45.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: True story.

asr-000316
00:28:46.440 --> 00:28:48.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Oo, true story.

asr-000317
00:28:48.720 --> 00:28:53.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At noon po kasi iba pa ho yung kanyang love life.

asr-000318
00:28:53.320 --> 00:28:56.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ang kanyang girlfriend ho noon ay iba.

asr-000319
00:28:56.100 --> 00:28:58.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: E babae ho yung pinanganak.

asr-000320
00:28:58.540 --> 00:29:02.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Kaya ipinangalan po doon sa dati niyang girlfriend, yung naging anak noong buntis.

asr-000321
00:29:03.140 --> 00:29:04.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: If you, Vina ang ano noon.

asr-000322
00:29:09.180 --> 00:29:10.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: True story po yun.

asr-000323
00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:12.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sino yung Vina?

asr-000324
00:29:19.760 --> 00:29:25.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Huwag na ho at baka ho merong hindi na ka-insure, biglang madali.

asr-000325
00:29:26.100 --> 00:29:32.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sa ating Senate Majority Floor Leader, Sen. Juan Miguel Migs Zubiri.

asr-000326
00:29:33.140 --> 00:29:39.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At ganun din po ang ating magiting na senador,

asr-000327
00:29:40.100 --> 00:29:45.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ang ating committee at chairman ng committee on finance po.

asr-000328
00:29:46.160 --> 00:29:48.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At kami po ay nagsusubscribe.

asr-000329
00:29:48.520 --> 00:29:54.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Alam niyo po, kami po ay lumuluhod sa inyo, Sen. JV Ejercito.

asr-000330
00:29:56.100 --> 00:29:59.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Kung naniniwala po kami sa Golden Rule po.

asr-000332
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: that he who has the gold makes the rules.

asr-000333
00:30:02.940 --> 00:30:05.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Eh, kayo ang Committee on Finance,

asr-000334
00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:08.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: kaya po lumulod din ho kami sa inyo.

asr-000335
00:30:09.240 --> 00:30:12.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At sa lahat-lahat po ng mga kagalang-galang

asr-000336
00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:16.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: na mga kasama natin sa pagsisilbi sa ating bansa,

asr-000337
00:30:17.840 --> 00:30:21.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: pipilitin po namin na makapagbigay.

asr-000338
00:30:21.880 --> 00:30:23.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ito po ang mandate natin,

asr-000339
00:30:24.400 --> 00:30:27.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: taon-taon na nagpe-presenta tayo

asr-000340
00:30:27.940 --> 00:30:30.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: sa magiging sponsor natin sa plenary

asr-000341
00:30:30.880 --> 00:30:33.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ng budget ng iba't-ibang ahensya.

asr-000342
00:30:34.280 --> 00:30:36.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At ngayon po, naririto kami.

asr-000343
00:30:36.620 --> 00:30:41.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sana mabigyan namin ng magandang paliwanag

asr-000344
00:30:42.720 --> 00:30:45.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ang inyo pong Committee, Mr. Chairman,

asr-000345
00:30:46.820 --> 00:30:51.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: tungkol sa budget ng Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-000346
00:30:51.600 --> 00:30:57.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: at pipilitin po namin na makompleto po ito

asr-000347
00:30:57.100 --> 00:30:57.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: kahit na po.

asr-000348
00:30:57.940 --> 00:31:00.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Medyo puyat na puyat po kami

asr-000349
00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:02.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: sa kapapanood ng Samoan Someday.

asr-000350
00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:06.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Malapit na po kasing matapos eh.

asr-000351
00:31:06.320 --> 00:31:08.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Kaya po, exciting na po.

asr-000352
00:31:08.560 --> 00:31:09.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Kaya nanonood kami yan.

asr-000353
00:31:09.880 --> 00:31:12.200
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Marami pong puyat dito sa kakapanood nun eh.

asr-000354
00:31:15.160 --> 00:31:17.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Kaya po, allow me.

asr-000355
00:31:17.280 --> 00:31:19.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kung pwede, panuorin po din ninyo yung

asr-000356
00:31:19.660 --> 00:31:20.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Honored I Matter.

asr-000357
00:31:24.620 --> 00:31:25.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Nag-plug na rin eh.

asr-000358
00:31:27.940 --> 00:31:28.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sige nga.

asr-000359
00:31:30.920 --> 00:31:32.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Manonood din po kami.

asr-000360
00:31:32.620 --> 00:31:34.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: O bago po nung plenary namin dito,

asr-000361
00:31:34.560 --> 00:31:35.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: manonood na po kami nun.

asr-000362
00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:41.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Well, seriously, it is with utmost respect

asr-000363
