asr-000370
00:31:59.940 --> 00:32:03.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: during his 2026 State of the Nation Address.

asr-000371
00:32:04.160 --> 00:32:05.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ang sabi po niya,

asr-000372
00:32:05.600 --> 00:32:06.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: asahan ninyo,

asr-000373
00:32:07.260 --> 00:32:09.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: kukompletuhin na nating ngayong taon

asr-000374
00:32:09.640 --> 00:32:12.820
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ang ginagawa nating pagpapawalang-bisa

asr-000375
00:32:12.820 --> 00:32:19.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: sa mga utang ng ating mga beneficiaryo.

asr-000376
00:32:20.460 --> 00:32:22.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This directive gives clear direction

asr-000377
00:32:23.500 --> 00:32:26.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to the Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-000378
00:32:26.280 --> 00:32:26.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to fulfill

asr-000379
00:32:26.780 --> 00:32:27.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the mandate of the law

asr-000381
00:32:27.980 --> 00:32:30.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: by completing this year

asr-000382
00:32:30.960 --> 00:32:33.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the debt condonation process

asr-000383
00:32:33.240 --> 00:32:36.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for our agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000384
00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:39.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This is anchored on Republic Act 11953

asr-000385
00:32:40.560 --> 00:32:43.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act

asr-000386
00:32:43.420 --> 00:32:45.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: which institutionalized the condonation

asr-000387
00:32:46.540 --> 00:32:48.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of the unpaid amortizations,

asr-000388
00:32:50.140 --> 00:32:51.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: interests, penalties,

asr-000389
00:32:51.700 --> 00:32:52.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and other related obligations

asr-000390
00:32:53.540 --> 00:32:57.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of qualified agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000391
00:32:57.920 --> 00:33:00.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The work of agrarian reform

asr-000392
00:33:00.440 --> 00:33:03.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: has been a continuing commitment

asr-000393
00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:04.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of the Philippine government.

asr-000394
00:33:05.260 --> 00:33:07.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: On September 26, 1972,

asr-000395
00:33:07.980 --> 00:33:11.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Presidential Decree No. 2

asr-000396
00:33:11.260 --> 00:33:13.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: declared the entire Philippines

asr-000397
00:33:13.620 --> 00:33:15.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: a land reform area.

asr-000398
00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:17.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Followed on October 21

asr-000399
00:33:17.960 --> 00:33:21.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: by Presidential Decree No. 27

asr-000400
00:33:21.660 --> 00:33:24.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: or PD-27,

asr-000401
00:33:24.880 --> 00:33:26.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the Tenant Emancipation Decree

asr-000403
00:33:27.700 --> 00:33:29.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It sought to emancipate tenant farmers

asr-000404
00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:31.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: by transferring ownership

asr-000405
00:33:31.880 --> 00:33:33.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of the land they tilled.

asr-000406
00:33:34.620 --> 00:33:36.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: More than five decades later,

asr-000407
00:33:36.620 --> 00:33:37.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: on July 7, 2023,

asr-000408
00:33:39.220 --> 00:33:41.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Republic Act 11953

asr-000409
00:33:41.460 --> 00:33:44.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act

asr-000410
00:33:44.280 --> 00:33:45.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: continued this legacy.

asr-000411
00:33:46.520 --> 00:33:47.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And today,

asr-000412
00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:51.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr.

asr-000413
00:33:51.580 --> 00:33:52.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and I,

asr-000414
00:33:52.580 --> 00:33:53.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and all of us,

asr-000415
00:33:54.660 --> 00:33:56.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: carry this responsibility forward

asr-000416
00:33:56.560 --> 00:33:57.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from land distribution

asr-000434
00:33:58.560 --> 00:34:08.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and debt condonation to agrarian justice and the empowerment of our farmers. The years 2022 to 2026

asr-000435
00:34:08.480 --> 00:34:10.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: may aptly be described

asr-000436
00:34:10.620 --> 00:34:11.740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: as the banner years

asr-000437
00:34:11.740 --> 00:34:13.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for the Department of Agrarian Reform.

asr-000438
00:34:14.680 --> 00:34:15.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In 2022,

asr-000439
00:34:16.620 --> 00:34:18.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: at the beginning of this administration,

asr-000440
00:34:19.460 --> 00:34:20.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR immediately strengthened

asr-000441
00:34:20.940 --> 00:34:22.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the implementation

asr-000442
00:34:22.400 --> 00:34:24.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of its core mandate.

asr-000443
00:34:25.020 --> 00:34:26.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We distributed

asr-000444
00:34:26.020 --> 00:34:27.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 21,876

asr-000445
00:34:27.480 --> 00:34:34.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: land titles covering approximately 25,159 hectares

asr-000446
00:34:34.540 --> 00:34:40.740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and benefiting 24,804 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000447
00:34:40.740 --> 00:34:48.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This represented a 124% increase over the baseline period.

asr-000448
00:34:49.320 --> 00:34:53.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At the same time, DARA reinforced its legal service system

asr-000449
00:34:53.180 --> 00:34:56.580
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and strengthened its rural development campaign.

asr-000450
00:34:57.480 --> 00:35:01.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In 2023, a historic milestone was achieved.

asr-000451
00:35:02.260 --> 00:35:08.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Republic Act 11953 or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act was signed into law.

asr-000452
00:35:08.260 --> 00:35:14.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: A landmark measure that was acted upon swiftly by legislators

asr-000453
00:35:14.260 --> 00:35:18.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and received broad support to liberate our beloved farmers

asr-000454
00:35:18.560 --> 00:35:21.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from the burden of agrarian debt.

asr-000455
00:35:21.820 --> 00:35:24.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Maraming salamat po sa ating mga senador.

asr-000456
00:35:25.180 --> 00:35:27.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Wala hong kumontra dito at ganon din po.

asr-000457
00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:30.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sa House of Representatives.

asr-000458
00:35:31.740 --> 00:35:36.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ang sinasabi po sa akin, kasi ho, kami po ay nagdi-distribute

asr-000459
00:35:37.000 --> 00:35:42.200
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ng mga certificates of condonation na iparating daw ho sa inyo,

asr-000460
00:35:42.840 --> 00:35:45.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: mga kagalanggalang na mga senador,

asr-000461
00:35:46.500 --> 00:35:49.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ang kanilang taus-pusong pasasalamat dito sa batas na ito.

asr-000462
00:35:50.780 --> 00:35:54.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: During this year, the Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-000463
00:35:54.040 --> 00:35:57.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: distributed 69,897 land titles.

asr-000464
00:35:57.480 --> 00:36:02.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Equivalent to 84,044 hectares.

asr-000465
00:36:03.900 --> 00:36:08.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Benefiting 73,399 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000466
00:36:09.920 --> 00:36:10.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Halos dumoble po.

asr-000467
00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:17.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This represented a 396% increase over the baseline period.

asr-000468
00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:21.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We recognize the invaluable role of our legislators

asr-000469
00:36:21.500 --> 00:36:24.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: in making this landmark legislation possible.

asr-000470
00:36:24.900 --> 00:36:27.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Maraming salamat po sa ating mga senador.

asr-000471
00:36:27.480 --> 00:36:29.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Mga kagalanggalang na mga babatas.

asr-000472
00:36:30.100 --> 00:36:36.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In 2024, DAR began the nationwide distribution of certificates of condolation

asr-000473
00:36:36.360 --> 00:36:39.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: with release of mortgage or CACROMs.

asr-000474
00:36:40.700 --> 00:36:44.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This was a historic first for the Department.

asr-000475
00:36:45.220 --> 00:36:48.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We continued to strengthen our land distribution program.

asr-000476
00:36:49.080 --> 00:36:56.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We were able to distribute 102,536 land titles

asr-000477
00:36:56.100 --> 00:36:57.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: covering the land distribution program.

asr-000478
00:36:57.480 --> 00:37:01.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 120,772 hectares.

asr-000479
00:37:02.040 --> 00:37:08.380
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And benefiting 88,310 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000480
00:37:09.300 --> 00:37:15.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This accomplishment represented a 581% increase

asr-000481
00:37:15.040 --> 00:37:18.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: over the baseline period.

asr-000482
00:37:20.460 --> 00:37:21.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Noon pong 2025,

asr-000483
00:37:21.700 --> 00:37:26.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the Department significantly accelerated both land distribution

asr-000484
00:37:27.480 --> 00:37:28.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and debt condolation.

asr-000485
00:37:28.920 --> 00:37:34.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We distributed 199,838 land titles

asr-000486
00:37:34.880 --> 00:37:39.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: covering 302,540 hectares

asr-000487
00:37:39.880 --> 00:37:46.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and benefiting 176,202 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000488
00:37:47.820 --> 00:37:54.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This represented 1,133% increase over the baseline period.

asr-000489
00:37:54.500 --> 00:37:56.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: More importantly,

asr-000490
00:37:56.020 --> 00:37:57.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: we distributed

asr-000491
00:37:57.140 --> 00:38:05.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 252,953 certificates of condonation

asr-000492
00:38:05.520 --> 00:38:06.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and release of mortgage

asr-000493
00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:09.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: with a total amount condoned

asr-000494
00:38:09.220 --> 00:38:13.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: at approximately 35.69 billion pesos.

asr-000495
00:38:14.260 --> 00:38:20.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This brings us to the central priority for 2026.

asr-000496
00:38:21.060 --> 00:38:23.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Pursuant to Republic 11953,

asr-000497
00:38:24.820 --> 00:38:26.580
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR was mandated to complete

asr-000498
00:38:26.580 --> 00:38:28.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the debt condolation process

asr-000499
00:38:28.280 --> 00:38:30.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: by June 30, 2026.

asr-000500
00:38:31.280 --> 00:38:33.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we have fully complied

asr-000501
00:38:33.180 --> 00:38:35.680
