asr-000505
00:38:43.340 --> 00:38:45.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: yung nasa BARM area.

asr-000506
00:38:46.640 --> 00:38:47.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ngunit,

asr-000507
00:38:47.840 --> 00:38:49.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: na-process na ho namin yun.

asr-000508
00:38:49.700 --> 00:38:51.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Na-validate na namin yun.

asr-000509
00:38:51.120 --> 00:38:53.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yun na lang hong distribution sa BARM area.

asr-000510
00:38:54.260 --> 00:38:56.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Minabuti namin natapusin ho muna.

asr-000511
00:38:56.580 --> 00:38:58.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yung eleksyon bago ho namin

asr-000512
00:38:58.680 --> 00:38:59.640
