asr-000690
00:45:16.020 --> 00:45:36.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At tinulad na rin po namin yung style po ng barangay courts to declug the RTCs, the MTCs, the Court of Appeals and Supreme Court.

asr-000691
00:45:36.700 --> 00:45:44.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ganon din yung ginawa namin. Meron na rin ho kaming mga barangay courts na pinag-uusap-usap na lang ho.

asr-000692
00:45:44.980 --> 00:45:57.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Para hindi ho dumami ang kaso. Meron nga ho kaming Agrarian Reform Justice on Wheels, ARJOW.

asr-000693
00:45:59.260 --> 00:46:11.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Similarly, the Department of Agrarian Reform Adjudication Board or DARAB has maintained a strong record in resolving agrarian disputes.

asr-000694
00:46:11.680 --> 00:46:14.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yan din po sa DARAB din po which is the Department of Agrarian Reform Adjudication Board.

asr-000695
00:46:14.980 --> 00:46:40.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At tumaas din po ang aming resolution na performance. From January to June 2026, we resolved 7,396 cases out of 9,874 or 74.9%. As of June ho yan.

asr-000696
00:46:41.300 --> 00:46:43.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These accomplishments demonstrate the Department's continuing commitment

asr-000697
00:46:43.280 --> 00:46:44.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to strengthen the legal foundations of agrarian reform

asr-000698
00:46:44.980 --> 00:46:59.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and ensure that disputes involving farmers, beneficiaries, tenancy, and leasehold are addressed through appropriate legal mechanisms.

asr-000699
00:47:00.520 --> 00:47:14.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The third pillar is agrarian reform beneficiaries development and sustainability. Under this pillar, DAR continues to provide support services that enable our farmers not only to own land, but to make a viable and sustainable livelihood from it.

asr-000700
00:47:14.980 --> 00:47:44.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And one important form of support is irrigation. Katatapos lang ho ng NIA kanina dito. I'm sure they also presented that we have in NIA, pondo po namin 'yon, 'yung CARP funds, pero sa kanila po, sila po ang nag-i-implement, and we are monitoring it also. Wala naman hong nakikitang

asr-000701
00:47:44.960 --> 00:47:52.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Nakikita nga mga Casper the Friendly Ghost po doon sa kono. Wala ho.

asr-000702
00:47:53.020 --> 00:48:07.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026, DAR has facilitated 285 irrigation projects of which 233 have been completed and 52 are ongoing.

asr-000703
00:48:07.440 --> 00:48:24.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These projects amount to approximately 5.02 billion covering 34,711.74 hectares and benefiting 40,775 farmer beneficiaries.

asr-000704
00:48:25.060 --> 00:48:37.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Importantly, the majority of these irrigation facilities are solar-powered, providing a more sustainable and cost-efficient source of water for agriculture.

asr-000705
00:48:37.440 --> 00:48:46.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We have also continued to improve physical connectivity through farm-to-market roads.

asr-000706
00:48:46.940 --> 00:48:56.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These roads help address one of the persistent challenges faced by farmers bringing their produce from farm to market.

asr-000707
00:48:56.240 --> 00:49:06.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ako po ay naniniwala doon po sa sinabi kanina ng ating gagalang-galang na majority floor leader na lumaki po ang kita.

asr-000708
00:49:06.460 --> 00:49:18.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ang ating mga magsasaka dahil po dyan sa mga daan na yan at pati sa mga tulay na nagawa po, hindi lang po sa bukid nun yan, sa buong Pilipinas po nangyayari yan.

asr-000709
00:49:19.960 --> 00:49:24.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At salamat din po sa tulong ninyo, pagbigay ninyo ng pondo sa amin.

asr-000710
00:49:25.800 --> 00:49:35.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: There are also 89 ongoing projects covering approximately 108.351 kilometers and benefiting 26,000.

asr-000711
00:49:36.460 --> 00:49:38.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 8,953 ARBs.

asr-000712
00:49:39.120 --> 00:49:47.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Wala ho doon sa farm-to-market roads namin, wala ho farm-to-pocket roads doon.

asr-000713
00:49:47.640 --> 00:49:48.760
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And kompleto ho yun.

