01:43:40.440 --> 01:43:41.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At kung ano ho,

asr-002258
01:43:41.720 --> 01:43:43.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: hindi lang ho yan,

asr-002259
01:43:44.440 --> 01:43:46.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: binibigyan din namin sila ng mga

asr-002260
