DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: farm machineries and equipment,

asr-002261
01:43:48.560 --> 01:43:50.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: mga post-harvest

asr-002262
01:43:50.240 --> 01:43:52.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: facilities, at

asr-002263
01:43:52.120 --> 01:43:53.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: binibigyan din natin sila ng irrigation

asr-002264
01:43:53.960 --> 01:43:55.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: at kung ano-ano pa ho.

