Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002266
01:43:59.660 --> 01:44:01.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Interested ako kung we came across

asr-002267
01:44:01.580 --> 01:44:03.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: may project pala kayong

asr-002268
01:44:03.140 --> 01:44:06.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung pang-agraryong tulay

asr-002269
01:44:06.260 --> 01:44:07.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa bagong bayanihan

asr-002270
01:44:07.760 --> 01:44:08.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng magsasaka.

asr-002271
01:44:09.440 --> 01:44:11.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Foreign assisted, is this a foreign assisted?

asr-002272
01:44:11.960 --> 01:44:13.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Otherwise known as the PBBM

asr-002273
01:44:13.780 --> 01:44:14.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Bridges po.

asr-002274
01:44:15.500 --> 01:44:17.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, it has a funding project

asr-002275
01:44:17.400 --> 01:44:20.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: cost about 28.243

asr-002276
01:44:20.080 --> 01:44:21.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: billion, which will be implemented

asr-002277
01:44:21.480 --> 01:44:23.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in partnership with the DPWH

asr-002278
01:44:23.880 --> 01:44:25.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and the host LGUs

asr-002279
01:44:25.980 --> 01:44:26.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for the next,

asr-002280
01:44:26.680 --> 01:44:28.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ah, five years.

asr-002281
01:44:28.840 --> 01:44:30.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang ano lang natin dito is,

asr-002282
01:44:30.620 --> 01:44:32.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: um, may request sa

asr-002283
01:44:32.600 --> 01:44:34.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: list of areas where our agri-reform

asr-002284
01:44:34.520 --> 01:44:36.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: beneficiaries will be benefited by this.

asr-002285
01:44:36.860 --> 01:44:38.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes, sir. Yes, sir.

asr-002286
01:44:38.580 --> 01:44:40.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Saan natin yung pondo?

asr-002287
01:44:40.220 --> 01:44:42.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Where is it parked?

asr-002288
01:44:42.360 --> 01:44:43.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is it French? Tama ba? Totoo? French?

asr-002289
01:44:44.240 --> 01:44:46.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ah, so it's foreign assisted

asr-002290
01:44:46.560 --> 01:44:48.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: project. May counterpart

asr-002291
01:44:48.720 --> 01:44:49.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ng DAR.

asr-002292
01:44:49.920 --> 01:44:50.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang DAR.

asr-002293
01:44:52.980 --> 01:44:54.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ya, ilan ang GOP natin?

asr-002294
01:44:55.400 --> 01:44:56.620
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: The total project,

asr-002295
01:44:56.680 --> 01:44:58.380
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: the project cost is 28,000.

asr-002296
01:44:58.380 --> 01:44:59.280
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: If you want a more second.

asr-002297
01:44:59.740 --> 01:44:59.920
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Yes.

asr-002298
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:11.720
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Mr. Chairman, yes, 28 billion ang total budget and 22.5 is the LP, loan proceeds, and 5 point something is the GOP natin.

asr-002299
01:45:12.620 --> 01:45:13.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-002300
01:45:15.300 --> 01:45:20.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, at least maganda ito sa French government, ano?

asr-002301
01:45:21.340 --> 01:45:29.160
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Yeah, the French government, they have offered to us both funders, two funders, the French Treasury and the AFD.

asr-002302
01:45:29.160 --> 01:45:33.360
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: So, both bilateral group.

asr-002303
01:45:34.740 --> 01:45:37.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How many bridges ang ano nito, target na ito?

asr-002304
01:45:38.120 --> 01:45:42.900
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: There's a total of 350 bridges all over the country.

asr-002305
01:45:43.120 --> 01:45:46.360
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: We've submitted, actually, we submitted almost a thousand.

asr-002306
01:45:47.240 --> 01:45:55.500
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And when we defended this to NEDA, it went down to 700 and later on to 350 because they went over it.

asr-002307
01:45:55.500 --> 01:45:59.060
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And it requires the EIRR, as we call it, Economic Internal.

asr-002308
01:45:59.160 --> 01:46:10.160
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Rate of Return, that all bridges should be validated, checked, whether the hectarage of that area will suit the purpose of building something to connect the other side

asr-002309
01:46:10.160 --> 01:46:18.120
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: and will serve the purpose of giving all the farmers a chance to shorten their trip, to carry their load, etc., etc.

asr-002310
01:46:18.300 --> 01:46:21.380
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And how many farmers are there in that particular area?

asr-002311
01:46:21.380 --> 01:46:28.480
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: So, maraming natanggal, yung mga ibang Congress pa nga, nagtatanong, bakit sa amin, meron doon kaming request, bakit wala?

asr-002312
01:46:28.680 --> 01:46:29.000
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: So, but...

asr-002313
01:46:29.160 --> 01:46:36.400
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: NEDA or DEPDev just scratched them out because they did not reach the target of their EIRR formula.

asr-002314
01:46:37.520 --> 01:46:41.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Who decides which community gets a bridge?

asr-002315
01:46:42.340 --> 01:46:47.220
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Basically, we've submitted almost a good number of ARC areas.

asr-002316
01:46:47.220 --> 01:46:53.740
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And NEDA themselves approved the areas for those areas that has been approved.

asr-002317
01:46:53.780 --> 01:46:56.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the areas are actually ARC areas?

asr-002318
01:46:56.740 --> 01:46:58.220
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: ARC areas with ARBOs.

asr-002319
01:46:59.160 --> 01:47:00.800
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: AR, Agrarian Reform Beneficiary.

asr-002320
01:47:01.520 --> 01:47:03.640
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: They have to be ARC areas.

asr-002321
01:47:03.740 --> 01:47:06.680
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: You cannot qualify if you're not Agrarian Reform Community areas.

asr-002322
01:47:07.460 --> 01:47:10.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Can we see the list?

asr-002323
01:47:10.940 --> 01:47:13.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Can this list be submitted so that we can identify?

asr-002324
01:47:14.320 --> 01:47:14.840
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Yes, sir.

asr-002325
01:47:14.960 --> 01:47:15.340
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Yes, sir.

asr-002326
01:47:15.340 --> 01:47:18.720
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: We'll submit it to you in your office, Senator.

asr-002327
01:47:19.140 --> 01:47:25.980
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And we just hope that we'll just keep it among to ourselves because there's a lot of scrupulous people going around.

asr-002328
01:47:26.400 --> 01:47:29.000
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: And as soon as I get the picture out of it, they go to...

asr-002329
01:47:29.160 --> 01:47:32.700
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: To all other areas and negotiate and so on and so on and so forth.

asr-002330
01:47:32.940 --> 01:47:33.760
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: It's a lot of foolishness.

asr-002331
01:47:33.800 --> 01:47:35.620
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Actually, I've been relaying this to the Secretary.

asr-002332
01:47:35.800 --> 01:47:36.880
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: That gives us a headache.

asr-002333
01:47:40.300 --> 01:47:44.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We already alerted the NBI, Your Honor.

asr-002334
01:47:44.420 --> 01:47:47.800
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we will certainly entrap them, Your Honor.

asr-002335
01:47:48.180 --> 01:47:49.180
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: Yes, sir.

asr-002336
01:47:49.320 --> 01:47:50.640
DAR Undersecretary for Foreign Assisted and Special Projects Jesry T. Palmares: We will submit to you for sure.

asr-002337
01:47:50.920 --> 01:47:51.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-002338
01:47:51.580 --> 01:47:58.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's an interesting project and I'm sure it will make the Agrarian Reform Communities productive.

asr-002339
01:47:59.160 --> 01:48:01.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To be continuously productive.

asr-002340
01:48:02.060 --> 01:48:02.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-002341
01:48:03.020 --> 01:48:03.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002342
