Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Just a few more questions.

asr-002343
01:48:06.020 --> 01:48:12.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For example, what is a typical land area of a community?

asr-002344
01:48:14.260 --> 01:48:14.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yeah.

asr-002345
01:48:16.240 --> 01:48:18.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: I could answer that.

asr-002346
01:48:18.660 --> 01:48:19.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, go ahead, sir.

asr-002347
01:48:19.940 --> 01:48:25.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In most cases, it's about 200 beneficiaries.

asr-002348
01:48:26.900 --> 01:48:28.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Meron mga 200 hectares yan eh.

asr-002349
01:48:28.780 --> 01:48:28.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Okay.

asr-002350
01:48:29.160 --> 01:48:34.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 100 to 200 hectares or probably even more.

asr-002351
01:48:34.100 --> 01:48:48.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes, because especially, there is even an Agrarian Reform Community which was historically

asr-002352
01:48:48.960 --> 01:48:59.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: was a part of the National Agrarian Reform area.

asr-002353
01:48:59.160 --> 01:49:03.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: National Agrarian Reform Resettlement Area, NARA.

asr-002354
01:49:04.780 --> 01:49:09.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In Palawan, it is now a municipality, Your Honor.

asr-002355
01:49:11.020 --> 01:49:12.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes, yes.

asr-002356
01:49:13.900 --> 01:49:16.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: That's an Agrarian Reform Community, Your Honor.

asr-002357
01:49:16.900 --> 01:49:28.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And also, some of the barangays now, like the Hacienda Liet in Santa Barbara,

asr-002358
01:49:29.160 --> 01:49:32.200
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: it's now a barangay, Your Honor.

asr-002359
01:49:32.560 --> 01:49:35.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: That's how big the communities are.

asr-002360
01:49:36.380 --> 01:49:45.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I raise that question because, well, you know, there are debates about the need to allow

asr-002361
01:49:45.520 --> 01:49:50.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: large land holdings, private sector to invest, etc.

asr-002362
01:49:52.380 --> 01:49:53.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes and no.

asr-002363
01:49:53.400 --> 01:49:59.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Because, you know, if you give the Agrarian Reform Communities the interventions necessary,

asr-002364
01:49:59.160 --> 01:50:05.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: for them to have post-harvest facilities, to have farm-to-market roads, you cluster

asr-002365
01:50:05.920 --> 01:50:14.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: them and make sure, that's where you, in other words, government intervention to build capacity

asr-002366
01:50:14.300 --> 01:50:16.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: of your Agrarian Reform Communities.

asr-002367
01:50:16.580 --> 01:50:17.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I agree with you, Your Honor.

